            "alias": "mass-times",
            "categoryId": "24",
            "categoryTitle": "Homepage Articles",
            "introtext": "\t<h2 class=\"mt-big-title\">Mass Times</h2>\n<h3>Weekdays before Mass</h3>\n<p>Saturday Vigil: 5:00 pm<br />Sunday: 7:00 am, 9:00am, 11:00 am, and 5:00 pm<br />Daily: 8:00 am (no Mass on Wednesdays)</p>\n<h3>Mass (Via Livestream)</h3>\n<p>8:00 am Monday-Tuesday and Thursday-Saturday</p>\n<h3>Confession</h3>\n<p>Saturday at 3:30 pm in the church</p>\n<h3>Eucharistic Adoration</h3>\n<p>Chapel daily from 6:00 am to 9:00 pm</p>",
